                        <div class="container">
                            <div class="mil-banner-content mil-up">
                                <h1 class="mil-muted mil-mb-60"><span class="mil-thin">Welcome to </span>Shed </h1>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-md-7 col-lg-5">
                                        <p class="mil-light-soft mil-mb-60">Transform your inventory into a beautiful online storefront with just a few clicks. <strong>Shed's integrated e-commerce solution</strong> lets you reach customers 24/7 while managing everything from one dashboard.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <a href="/admin-register" class="mil-button mil-arrow-place mil-btn-space">
