                                        <p class="mil-light-soft mil-mb-30">Process sales, generate invoices, and accept payments effortlessly—whether in-store or remotely.</p>
                                        <div class="mil-button mil-icon-button-sm mil-arrow-place"></div>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 mil-services-grid-item p-0">
                                    <a href="#" class="mil-service-card-sm mil-up">
                                        <h5 class="mil-muted mil-mb-30">Multi-Outlet &<br>Affiliate Support</h5>
                                        <p class="mil-light-soft mil-mb-30">Manage multiple outlets, track commissions, and empower affiliates with a built-in referral program.</p>
                                        <div class="mil-button mil-icon-button-sm mil-arrow-place"></div>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 mil-services-grid-item p-0">
                                    <a href="#" class="mil-service-card-sm mil-up">
