                                        <ol>
                                            <li>Add products (with images, prices & stock levels)</li>
                                            <li>Set up payment methods (cash, bank transfer, etc.)</li>
                                            <li>Customize your store's branding (logo, colors, currency)</li>
                                        </ol>
                                    </div>
